# P88 on Windows (WinUI): hover, hold Command (the Windows key) without and with moving, drag across the panel, end inside it -- actions/mac/P88-hover-cmd-drag.actions. The panel exposes nothing to UIA; measured 2026-10-20 with test_support/measure/measure_win.zsh the readouts start at y 410 DIPs in a 454-wide window, so the Mac file's positions lie inside the panel above them. Win32Synthesiser taps an unassigned key before releasing the Windows key, so the Start menu stays shut.
# Pass: pointer follows, (cmd) appears while the Windows key is held, last with cmd kept, drags counted, hover reports above 0.
